      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW AMARLI (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (25.58) at Ballarat behind Black Star Riot in a Grade 4/5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Capable of going well again. PRINCESS DOMI (4) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 4.5 lengths at Horsham (23.77). Expected to feature in the finish. CHEEKY STREAK (2) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a three-run winning streak, but could only manage second (23.25) at Geelong. Winning chance. DAINTREE GAV (6) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
